    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World's First Card + Backpack System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards + Backpack Management, Pre-battle + Mid-battle = Dual Strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Micro-control + Auto Combat: Enjoy explosive battles without operational burden! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Strategic Real-time Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/2ec14cd1ae68537f5a642d21f0b5172e.poster.avif?t=1752723967\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/2ec14cd1ae68537f5a642d21f0b5172e.webm?t=1752723967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/2ec14cd1ae68537f5a642d21f0b5172e.mp4?t=1752723967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Artifact Backpack &amp; Bond System enhance pre-battle depth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse card mechanics + unique character energy systems secure mid-battle tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Time ensures decision space \u2013 no frantic button-mashing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. 1+1&gt;2 Dual-Character System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True dual characters: Independent hands, simultaneous dual-line operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergy-triggered Emergence enables 1+1&gt;2 combos:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gale Slash + Black Hole = Tornado</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice Arrow + Tornado = Blizzard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/f93905d756146d7526c9b8387a39807f.poster.avif?t=1752723967\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/f93905d756146d7526c9b8387a39807f.webm?t=1752723967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/f93905d756146d7526c9b8387a39807f.mp4?t=1752723967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireball + Ice Arrow = Magma</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tornado + Lightning = Thunder Twister</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thunder Twister + Lightning Orb = Violet Thunder Dragon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More combos await discovery! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Farmable Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeatable stages + Non-repeating Artifact drops = Target-farm your build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mastery of Backpack Management &amp; Artifact synergy defines the ceiling \u2013 not RNG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >discord\uff1a</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World's First Card + Backpack System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards + Backpack Management, Pre-battle + Mid-battle = Dual Strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Micro-control + Auto Combat: Enjoy explosive battles without operational burden! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Strategic Real-time Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/2ec14cd1ae68537f5a642d21f0b5172e.poster.avif?t=1752723967\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/2ec14cd1ae68537f5a642d21f0b5172e.webm?t=1752723967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/2ec14cd1ae68537f5a642d21f0b5172e.mp4?t=1752723967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Artifact Backpack &amp; Bond System enhance pre-battle depth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse card mechanics + unique character energy systems secure mid-battle tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Time ensures decision space \u2013 no frantic button-mashing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. 1+1&gt;2 Dual-Character System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True dual characters: Independent hands, simultaneous dual-line operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergy-triggered Emergence enables 1+1&gt;2 combos:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gale Slash + Black Hole = Tornado</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice Arrow + Tornado = Blizzard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/f93905d756146d7526c9b8387a39807f.poster.avif?t=1752723967\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/f93905d756146d7526c9b8387a39807f.webm?t=1752723967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/f93905d756146d7526c9b8387a39807f.mp4?t=1752723967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireball + Ice Arrow = Magma</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tornado + Lightning = Thunder Twister</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thunder Twister + Lightning Orb = Violet Thunder Dragon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More combos await discovery! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Farmable Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeatable stages + Non-repeating Artifact drops = Target-farm your build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mastery of Backpack Management &amp; Artifact synergy defines the ceiling \u2013 not RNG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >discord\uff1a</p>",
